# Agent-private folders: a local projection of a maintainer skill is never committed.
/.claude/
/.kiro/
/.codex/

# Never ignore a skill directory, whatever its name (coverage, tmp, target...).
!**/skills/*/

# Keep client manifests, lockfiles, fixtures, assets, and distributable build
